# ==============================================================================
# CUSTOS — GIT IGNORE SPECIFICATION
# Rust-First Polyglot Monorepo
#
# Nguyên tắc:
# 1. Canonical vs Derived — chỉ ignore derived
# 2. Secrets tuyệt đối — không bao giờ commit secrets
# 3. Cross-platform — macOS, Linux, Windows
# 4. Polyglot-aware — Rust, Python, TypeScript, SQL, YAML, TOML
# ==============================================================================


