# ==============================================================================
# 19. FINAL RULES — ĐẢM BẢO KHÔNG BỎ SÓT
# ==============================================================================

# ⚠️ KHÔNG BAO GIỜ IGNORE:
# Cargo.lock
# pnpm-lock.yaml
# uv.lock
# .env.example
# schemas/fixtures/
# domain-packs/
# docs/adr/
# docs/UPSTREAM_SOURCE_MAP.md
# tests/
# evaluation/datasets/

# ⚠️ FORCE INCLUDE các file quan trọng:
!Cargo.lock
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!uv.lock
!.env.example
!schemas/fixtures/**
!domain-packs/**
!docs/adr/**
!docs/UPSTREAM_SOURCE_MAP.md
!tests/**
!evaluation/datasets/**